#. TRANSLATORS: Row label for the setting that adds silence between paragraphs when reading aloud
#: kt swift
msgid "Paragraph Pause"
msgstr "Szünet a bekezdések között"

#. TRANSLATORS: TalkBack value announced on the voice picker when the chosen engine offers nothing to choose between
#: kt
msgid "No other voices"
msgstr "Nincs más beszédhang"

#. TRANSLATORS: Export option that shares the document's own file, exactly as it is, rather than converting it
#: swift
msgid "Original file"
msgstr "Eredeti fájl"

#. TRANSLATORS: Toast confirming the document's settings were exported to a .paperback file, or the failure message if not
#: kt
msgid "Settings exported"
msgstr "Beállítások exportálva"

#. TRANSLATORS: Settings row showing the language Paperback is shown in; choosing it opens Paperback's page in the system Settings app, where the language can be changed
#: kt swift
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Nyelv"

#. TRANSLATORS: Footer under the Language row in Settings, explaining where it leads
#: kt swift
msgid "Opens Paperback in the Settings app, where its language can be changed."
msgstr "Megnyitja a Paperback oldalát a Beállítások alkalmazásban, ahol a nyelve módosítható."

#. TRANSLATORS: Accessibility label for the read-aloud bar's previous button when navigating by paragraph
#: kt swift
msgid "Previous Paragraph"
msgstr "Előző bekezdés"

#. TRANSLATORS: Accessibility label for the read-aloud bar's previous button when navigating by line
#: kt swift
msgid "Previous Line"
msgstr "Előző sor"

#. TRANSLATORS: Accessibility label for the read-aloud bar's next button when navigating by paragraph
#: kt swift
msgid "Next Paragraph"
msgstr "Következő bekezdés"

#. TRANSLATORS: Accessibility label for the read-aloud bar's next button when navigating by line
#: kt swift
msgid "Next Line"
msgstr "Következő sor"

#. TRANSLATORS: TalkBack action on the top bar's overflow button, which opens its menu
#: kt
msgid "Show all options in a menu"
msgstr "az összes lehetőség megjelenítése menüben"

#. TRANSLATORS: TalkBack action on a document tab that closes it; {} is the document's title
#: kt
msgid "Close {}"
msgstr "{} bezárása"

#. TRANSLATORS: TalkBack action on the read-aloud bar's unit selector, which opens the list of navigation units
#: kt
msgid "Select navigation unit"
msgstr "navigációs egység kiválasztása"

#. TRANSLATORS: TalkBack action on the read-aloud bar's speech rate control, which opens the list of rates
#: kt
msgid "Select speech rate"
msgstr "beszédsebesség kiválasztása"

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of the file manager's top level, which lists the device's storage volumes
#: kt
msgid "Storage Devices"
msgstr "Tárolóeszközök"

#. TRANSLATORS: TalkBack label for the file manager's row that goes up a folder; {} is the parent folder's name
#: kt
msgid "Go up to parent directory: {}"
msgstr "Ugrás a szülőmappába: {}"

#. TRANSLATORS: Toggle controlling whether TTS stops after the paragraph containing a Find match while Find is the navigation unit
#: swift kt
msgid "Stop reading after search matches"
msgstr "Felolvasás leállítása a keresési találatok után"

#. TRANSLATORS: Explanation of the Find playback setting; turning it off lets reading continue without changing the navigation unit
#: swift kt
msgid "Turn off to continue reading while navigating by search matches."
msgstr "Kapcsolja ki, ha a keresési találatok közötti navigálás közben folytatni szeretné a felolvasást."

#. TRANSLATORS: 1.5x line spacing option
#: swift
msgid "1.5\\u{00d7}"
msgstr "1,5\\u{00d7}"

#. TRANSLATORS: Row label in the Document Info sheet for how far through the document the reader has got
#: swift
#, fuzzy
msgid "Progress"
msgstr "Olvasási pozíció"
